{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-07_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-07",
  "title": "无暇哀悼",
  "storyCode": "10-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bab228dd6b1c87bde18c1088a3cf4f2274f0ec177052fbf3f0eeb3c54d6bcded",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "头儿，你说得没错，我们跟丢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那群反抗军......一个个的，比沙地兽还狡猾。就这一会工夫，他们就跟钻进沙堆里似的，完全没了影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......的确。所以，不要浪费精力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在他们下一次冒头之前，守好你们的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，头儿，你说了算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来你找到了一批忠心耿耿的新属下，“头儿”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们相信这里会有好收成，这令他们满怀斗志。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们也很信任你。我看得很清楚，这份信任已经远超一名雇佣兵对另一名雇佣兵该有的程度。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这说明曼弗雷德的计划很奏效。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你对他的评价很高。差点忘了，你们已经是推心置腹的好朋友了，对吧？他分给你的新居所，光是书房就比你之前住的院子还大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那间伯爵宅邸，它的主人正是死在我手上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别告诉我你的良心在发烫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当时他正在喝下午茶......他的妻子和三个孩子就坐在他面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这的确不是我们过去接的那种活。但这是你自己选的，所以我们都没资格为我们死去已久的良心哀悼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就别问那样的问题。你想确认什么，直接看就好。你明明都知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你压力很大，我难道就好过？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，不跟你说这些。眼下可不是向彼此寻求安慰的时候。我来找你，是想提醒你一句——多看看脚下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的意思是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雇佣兵总是没那么值得信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是走路的时候不多注意一下影子动向的话，小心功亏一篑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_393_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你想告诉我的，就是这个？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想说的是——兜兜转转这么久以后，她在路上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的人都就位了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，都按萨卡兹的意思，去那个地点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别犯傻了，我说的不是萨卡兹要我们做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长官，我们真的要在今晚行动吗？会不会......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是想说，我们会不会中曼弗雷德的圈套？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以为我蠢到看不出他想做什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，我不敢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是想试探我，我也会让他试探。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的人会任他调遣......但他不知道我们到底有几个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我们还是得好好帮萨卡兹守门？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......住嘴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我非常讨厌这个说法，听起来就像我们是萨卡兹的......萨卡兹的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，算了。我们只需要忍这一天了。等办完这最后一件事，我们就离开伦蒂尼姆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真、真的吗？长官，那我们可太高兴了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我从小就很讨厌伦蒂尼姆，我的爸爸妈妈都是来了这里就没回去过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个城市，它会吃人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯。我也不喜欢这里。你见过哪一座城市像这样，有这么多地块，这么多高楼，这么多排水沟的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每次闻到那股......那股贵族餐桌上的油脂味，我都会犯恶心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好在，我们终于可以走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "传话下去，晚上都给我“好好表现”。绝对不能让曼弗雷德看出破绽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外挑十个最能打的，跟着我行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我让你跟着曼弗雷德......你看清楚他刚才去哪里了，没错吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "深池士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_406_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，长官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天晚上......我一定要把我们的“间谍”救出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在伦蒂尼姆待了这么久，总要做成一件事，才好心安理得地回家吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蔓德拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_233_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我才不会让领袖失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "号角，你回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。罗本他们呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们也早就回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。药找到了吗？我去看看萨利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你不用去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？！你是说萨利他......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是得去看看他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "维多利亚又失去了一位好战士。\n一位可爱的姑娘也失去了一位好父亲。\n我们到底还要失去多少，才能看到这场悲剧的尾声？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨利的女儿叫什么名字？艾琳，还是艾尔莎？我记得他们一家住在阿斯卡拉郡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莱克，麻烦你把萨利的遗物收起来，等战争结束，我们去一趟他家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是......他什么都没留下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什么都没有留下来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，布莱克。他至少......留下了一段故事。我们还是得走一趟，他的女儿会想听一听......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会告诉她，即使在最黑暗的时刻，她的父亲都从未向苦痛低头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......好。我会陪你去，号角，我们等战争结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，萨利他给你留了一句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他......他说了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他说——“中尉，对不起，但是请你活下去。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他向我道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。而且，我理解他。我们都理解他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作为一名士兵，我们都想过，有一天可能会在哪里战死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是经历了这么多以后，萨利他......不，我们都体会到了什么才更可怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看如今的伦蒂尼姆，它明明是我们的家，却成了一座监狱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对我们来说，光荣地战死，是不是已经成了一种奢望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......本不该如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，但事实就是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们明明都清楚这一点，却还是......还是想要你坚持下去，因为是你给了我们希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "号角......你本来不用承担我们这么多人的希望。这太重了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "活下去......更难，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈......看来我欠她一个道歉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她和你们一样，是最优秀的维多利亚士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......先不说这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉其他人，我们没时间哀悼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "号角，你找到被关押的其他士兵的下落了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "几率很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我问出来的消息属实，萨卡兹明天上午就会把人都转移走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我本来......我打算问一下你们的意见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "维多利亚士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_422_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "号角，你不需要问，请直接下令吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "号角",
      "speakerId": "avg_4039_horn_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。等到天黑，我们立刻行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g6_hideout"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最有可能的关押位置我已在地图上标明了，诸位还有没有什么看法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还剩下......八个地点吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算加上我们的干员，想在两天之内排查完全部地点，也还是挺困难的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遗憾，这八个地点全都符合作为临时监狱的条件。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们附近都没有居民聚集区，这意味着很难有消息传入传出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它们同时也都位于通往中央区的干道附近，这方便萨卡兹士兵在内外城区之间往来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及......它们都并不与我们所在的地块连通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹的指挥官猜到了你们会在地下活动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他很聪明，我们绝不能小瞧他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......既然是用来关押俘虏的地方，是不是理应有重兵把守？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也考虑过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遗憾，我们的侦察人员追踪了萨卡兹士兵在各个区块的行动路线，但都没有发现破绽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这个位置是什么地方？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一家废弃工厂。以前据说是炼糖用的......对了，请不要误会，这只是流传在民用工业地带的一种俗称。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们炼制的是一种名为扭转醇的有机化合物，只是因为包装与深受孩子们喜爱的糖果近似，大家才戏称他们在“炼糖”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "炼糖厂？听起来好耳熟......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "请把这里列为首要排查的目标。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们或许接近答案了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "{@nickname}博士，能让我知道为什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我们可能认识这家炼糖厂的主人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......我想起来了。您是说......托马斯先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "托马斯先生一直在为萨卡兹干活，对不对？他说他看见萨卡兹在利用他的炼糖厂做一些事，而且他还因此差点被萨卡兹灭口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再加上深池......深池也想要托马斯先生身上的情报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所有站在萨卡兹对立面的势力都想要......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......萨卡兹不希望别人得到的情报。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通知费斯特，我们的第一目标是制醇厂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈默，你们的转移工作继续，我们依然随时做好两手准备......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指挥官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，劳伦斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "侦察小队回来了，他们在地面上遇到了萨卡兹雇佣兵——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......伤亡如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "四人负伤，一人......被俘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉了各位，会议中止，我得去看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......指挥官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自救军战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_398_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洛洛，你怎么来了？你的伤口才刚包扎好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......我有消息要亲口告诉指挥官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们难道找到了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我们得到了戈尔丁女士的消息。她还在北部居民区的学校里，她很安全......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他们在两天前的一场聚会中，遭到了萨卡兹的突袭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_4040_rockr_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信使女士她......被捕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请等一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们说的信使女士，就是委托你们接应罗德岛的那位吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那位帮助罗德岛进入维多利亚的女士。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那位搜集了许多维多利亚情报的女士。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那位凯尔希的老朋友。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......就是她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，{@nickname}博士，我们的救援计划得提前了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她对自救军非常重要。她掌握了许多情报，甚至可能影响到我们的撤离行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，我能理解......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_394_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对罗德岛来说，她也是不可或缺的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这将是我们第一次合作行动。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。我相信罗德岛能帮助我们救回那位被萨卡兹关押的信使——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛维希娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_401_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们最坚强的战士，最重要的同伴，最信任的朋友，海蒂·汤姆森女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
